{"product":{"id":6236632907964,"title":"Cortech Tiger Series Security Wall Plates - TP","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eCortech TP Tiger Series Security Wall Plates represent the finest in wiring device cover plates for use in high-abuse environments. The TP series is designed and built to hold up in the most extreme institutional and industrial environments. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh impact resistance\/virtually unbreakable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eArchitectural, smudge resistant white\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100% rust proof\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProtective side impact lip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTamperproof fastening system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmooth radius corners\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFast, easy installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTypes: TPSS Single Switch, TPDR Duplex Receptacle, TPBB Blank, TPGF Ground Fault Interrupter Receptacle, TPDBB Double Blank, TPDD Double Duplex Receptacle, TPDGF Double Ground Fault Interrupter Receptacles, TPDS Duplex Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCortech Tiger Plates are highly durable, injection-molded security wall plate covers.  Their one-piece construction is virtually unbreakable, tamper-resistant, and 100% rust-proof. Install into any surface with included hardware.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInjection molded in high strength Polycarbonate\/Nylon Blend, the TP series will not rust or break, and are oversized to accommodate mounting directly into any wall type and to allow for j-box opening and mounting surface imperfections.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech USA:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCortech USA (Correctional Technologies) manufactures products that are exceptionally durable, designed for use in compassionate and normative behavioral healthcare, corrections, law enforcement, heavy use commercial and industrial environments, parks and recreation, schools, universities, hospitals, emergency and homeless shelters, and other institutions and facilities where safety and durability matter. Cortech products are ideal for extreme use and intensive use environments.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Cortech","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-01-29T16:10:16-05:00","handle":"cortech-tp-tiger-series-security-wall-plates","updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:39:28-05:00","published_at":"2021-01-29T16:10:16-05:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"web","tags":"bh-behavioral-health-care-facility-furnishings, cortech-usa","variants":[{"id":37962709958844,"product_id":6236632907964,"title":"TPSS -  Single Switch","price":"17.60","sku":"C601648-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"22.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"TPSS -  Single Switch","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T16:10:18-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:39:28-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":907,"image_id":null,"weight":2.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":37962709991612,"product_id":6236632907964,"title":"TPDR - Single Duplex","price":"17.60","sku":"C601648-02","position":2,"compare_at_price":"22.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"TPDR - Single Duplex","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T16:10:18-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:39:28-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":907,"image_id":null,"weight":2.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":37962710024380,"product_id":6236632907964,"title":